{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>They said</b> — נאמו is missing a vav, and he did not specify who said it. And Rabbenu Marinus said: נאמו is from the same root as לא תונו, even though לא תונו is in the heavy stem and נאמו is in the light stem, like ונירם. And in my opinion: this is correct, and behold the proof: חרב היונה."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 74, :notes {0 "The verse lemma reads 'אמרו' in the source but Ibn Ezra's discussion concerns נאמו (Psalm 74:8); the lemma may reflect a manuscript variant or error. Rabbenu Marinus: epithet resolved by inference from Ibn Ezra's circle; identity uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:26.343531880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}